    ["Seventy Yard Range"] = "Halvfjerds Meter Rækkevidde",
    ["Shaw's agents have been as yet unable to find our mutual friend, but they have reported to me that he was last seen riding northeast from Astranaar in Ashenvale. It's not much, but at least he's alive.\n\nLight be with you.\n\n-Katherine"] = "Skaws agenter har endnu ikke kunnet finde vores fælles ven, men de har meldt til mig, at han sidst blev set ride mod nordøst fra Stjernelund i Askedalen. Det er ikke meget, men i det mindste er han i live.\n\nLet være med dig.\n\n-Katrine",
